// # ZK Submodule Hub -- Zero-Drag
//
// Logline: Zero-knowledge proofs (Groth16, PLONK, Bulletproofs, STARK, FRI), ZK-friendly curves (BN254, BLS12-381, Pasta), Merkle trees, KZG commitments, rollup state, and ZK hashes (Poseidon, Rescue, Pedersen). Re-exports a stable zk_mod_* surface for the most-used public API.
//
// Setup: Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Re-export Groth16 SNARK surface (zk_mod_groth16_*).
//   2. Re-export PLONK SNARK surface (zk_mod_plonk_*, both std zk and rollup versions).
//   3. Re-export Bulletproofs range proof surface.
//   4. Re-export STARK/FRI surface (zk_mod_stark_*, zk_mod_fri_*).
//   5. Re-export BN254, BLS12-381, Pasta curve surface.
//   6. Re-export Merkle tree, KZG, rollup, and ZK hash surface.
//   7. Document private siblings (_core, _verifier, _prover, _params, _stubs, _invariants files).

